WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Today I'll show you how to configure a Google Cloud Platform Project for Zync.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.500
Start on the Cloud Console project management page. 

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Click Create Project to make a new project to use with Zync.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Be sure to note the project ID.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Navigate to billing and ensure that billing is turned on.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:29.000
Now navigate to the API Manager and enable to the
Compute Engine and Zync Render APIs.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.500
Now navigate to zyncrender.com and click Register.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.000
Put in your Google Cloud Platform Project ID.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.250
Choose your site name and put in the company name.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.833
Now your registration is complete.

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:57.750
You will recieve an email with further instructions shortly.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Please check out some of our other Cloud Minute videos.

